* Install Nest Js CLI
  npm i -g @nestjs/cli

* Create New project 
  nest new NestJS-First-App

* Statr the new project 
  nest start:dev

* Create Module
  nest g module users

* Create Contoller
  nest g controller users

* Create Service
  nest g service users

* For object mapping reduce the bilerplate code
  npm i @nestjs/mapped-types -D

* To Validate the DTOs (mapped types and class transformers works together)
  npm i --save class-validator class-transformer

* Install Prisma for databa configuration
  npm i prisma -D

* Initiate Prisma(This will create the prisma folder)
  npx prisma init

* Define the Prisma schema and create the tables in Database.
  npx prisma migrate dev --name init

* Do changes in prisma file and change existing table(Run this command, then run aboce command with different name) 
  npx prisma generate

* Imprlementing rate limiting
  npm i @nestjs/throttler 

* create complete Crud module skeleton
  nest g resource employees

* Docker Build
  
  docker rm -f nest-app
  docker build -t nest-js-first-app:latest .
  docker run -d --name nest-app -p 3000:3000 --env-file .env nest-js-first-app:latest

  docker logs -f nest-app --since=10s







   